# Copy to .env — never commit the real one.
#
# ticker-news-signals needs NO API keys: GNews (Google News RSS) is keyless,
# and VADER sentiment is a local rule-based scorer.
#
# Optional tuning knobs below just mirror the NewsClient defaults; unset
# them to use the built-in values.

# Language / region of the Google News feed.
# TICKER_NEWS_LANGUAGE=en
# TICKER_NEWS_COUNTRY=US

# How far back the GNews feed reaches (h/d/m/y).  The pipeline sizes this
# from --lookback-hours automatically; override to change the feed window.
# TICKER_NEWS_PERIOD=1d